{"id": "DaX7DiUSwfz", "title": "Video by onsidianmen", "description": "Jiang Xueqin is an educator, author, and thought leader known for challenging traditional education and promoting creativity, critical thinking, and lifelong learning. His journey proves that true success comes from questioning the status quo and inspiring others to think differently.\n\nJiang’s path was built through years of teaching, research, and advocating for a better approach to education. Challenging conventional systems was not easy, and many of his ideas required courage, persistence, and a willingness to stand apart from traditional methods. Instead of following the crowd, he remained committed to creating meaningful change.\n\nHis success came from curiosity, innovation, and a passion for learning. Jiang believes that education should develop character, creativity, and problem-solving skills rather than simply memorizing information. His dedication to empowering students and encouraging independent thinking has made him a respected voice in modern education.\n\nToday, Jiang Xueqin continues to inspire educators, students, and leaders around the world through his ideas and teachings. His story reminds us that real success is not about knowing all the answers—it is about asking better questions, embracing lifelong learning, and helping others reach their full potential.\n\nOne page ⟡ Endless motivation.\n\nFollow @onsidianmen \n\n#JiangXueqin #Motivation #Education #SuccessMindset #LifelongLearning", "channel": "onsidianmen", "uploader_id": "13370755160", "uploader": "Onsidianman™", "timestamp": 1783174255, "like_count": 239241, "comment_count": 2103, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats"